20:["$","section",null,{"className":"faq-section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Frequently asked questions"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","details","Can a fresh graduate apply when a role asks for one year of experience?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Can a fresh graduate apply when a role asks for one year of experience?",["$","span",null,{"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Check whether internships, projects or part-time work count and whether the requirement is essential. Apply honestly when your evidence substantially matches the role."}]]}],["$","details","Are remote entry-level jobs available worldwide?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Are remote entry-level jobs available worldwide?",["$","span",null,{"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Remote usually describes the work arrangement, not global eligibility. Employers can restrict hiring by country, payroll or time zone."}]]}]]}]]}]
21:["$","p","UNDP's graduate overview distinguishes a relevant master's with up to one year of experience from a relevant bachelor's with two to three years. It requires readiness for a two-year international assignment. The dedicated page says the next campaign is under consideration; another UNDP overview uses different wording. No open call is asserted here.",{"children":"UNDP's graduate overview distinguishes a relevant master's with up to one year of experience from a relevant bachelor's with two to three years. It requires readiness for a two-year international assignment. The dedicated page says the next campaign is under consideration; another UNDP overview uses different wording. No open call is asserted here."}]
22:["$","p","OECD's 2026–2028 Young Associates round is closed. The route requires OECD-member nationality and excludes candidates enrolled in or holding a master's or PhD. It is therefore different from a broadly eligible graduate vacancy.",{"children":"OECD's 2026–2028 Young Associates round is closed. The route requires OECD-member nationality and excludes candidates enrolled in or holding a master's or PhD. It is therefore different from a broadly eligible graduate vacancy."}]
23:["$","section","2-A practical starting point for Pakistani graduates",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A practical starting point for Pakistani graduates"}],[["$","p","Check nationality and work-location requirements before preparing a long application. International recruitment can still be restricted to a participating-country list or to candidates with existing local work permission. If the advert does not address your case, ask recruitment a precise question and retain the answer.",{"children":"Check nationality and work-location requirements before preparing a long application. International recruitment can still be restricted to a participating-country list or to candidates with existing local work permission. If the advert does not address your case, ask recruitment a precise question and retain the answer."}],["$","p","Keep a separate search track for junior analyst, assistant, research-support, trainee and project-coordinator vacancies. Add your subject and permitted location, then find the advert and reference on the employer's own site. An unconfirmed annual programme belongs on a watch list while you pursue current roles.",{"children":"Keep a separate search track for junior analyst, assistant, research-support, trainee and project-coordinator vacancies. Add your subject and permitted location, then find the advert and reference on the employer's own site. An unconfirmed annual programme belongs on a watch list while you pursue current roles."}],["$","p","Before accepting an assessment, record the duty station, contract type, pay or allowance and working hours. Confirm any sponsorship rather than inferring it from the word international. Map relocation, deposits and other costs that arise before the first payment. For a remote role, verify the permitted work country and required overlap hours.",{"children":"Before accepting an assessment, record the duty station, contract type, pay or allowance and working hours. Confirm any sponsorship rather than inferring it from the word international. Map relocation, deposits and other costs that arise before the first payment. For a remote role, verify the permitted work country and required overlap hours."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for A practical starting point for Pakistani graduates","children":[["$","$L5","/graduate-programs/",{"href":"/graduate-programs/","children":["Compare graduate programme routes",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/graduate-assessment-centre/",{"href":"/guides/graduate-assessment-centre/","children":["Practise graduate assessment-centre decisions",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","3-Search with role families, not one job title",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Search with role families, not one job title"}],[["$","p","Employers label similar early-career work in different ways. Search combinations such as analyst, associate, trainee, coordinator, junior, assistant and graduate, then add your function and location.",{"children":"Employers label similar early-career work in different ways. Search combinations such as analyst, associate, trainee, coordinator, junior, assistant and graduate, then add your function and location."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Read required skills before years of experience",{"children":"Read required skills before years of experience"}],["$","li","Tailor achievements to the job description",{"children":"Tailor achievements to the job description"}],["$","li","Check the employer's own careers domain",{"children":"Check the employer's own careers domain"}],["$","li","Never pay for an interview or job offer",{"children":"Never pay for an interview or job offer"}],["$","li","Confirm visa sponsorship in writing",{"children":"Confirm visa sponsorship in writing"}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
25:["$","section","4-Translate education into workplace evidence",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Translate education into workplace evidence"}],[["$","p","A dissertation can prove research and project management; a team assignment can prove planning and conflict resolution; student leadership can prove stakeholder communication. Describe the task, your decisions and the outcome in language relevant to the role.",{"children":"A dissertation can prove research and project management; a team assignment can prove planning and conflict resolution; student leadership can prove stakeholder communication. Describe the task, your decisions and the outcome in language relevant to the role."}],["$","p","Keep claims proportionate. A clear example with a modest result is more credible than senior-sounding language that an interviewer cannot verify.",{"children":"Keep claims proportionate. A clear example with a modest result is more credible than senior-sounding language that an interviewer cannot verify."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
26:["$","section","5-Avoid recruitment scams",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Avoid recruitment scams"}],[["$","p","Search the vacancy reference on the employer's own careers site and verify the domain used for communication. Genuine employers do not require candidates to send money to unlock an interview, buy equipment from a named private seller or reveal online-banking credentials.",{"children":"Search the vacancy reference on the employer's own careers site and verify the domain used for communication. Genuine employers do not require candidates to send money to unlock an interview, buy equipment from a named private seller or reveal online-banking credentials."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
27:["$","section","6-Worked example: show evidence from a university project",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Worked example: show evidence from a university project"}],[["$","p","Consider a fictional applicant for a junior operations role requiring spreadsheet accuracy and coordination. The applicant has not managed a department, but did organise a student-event registration file. A useful example explains that work and its limits rather than inventing management responsibility.",{"children":"Consider a fictional applicant for a junior operations role requiring spreadsheet accuracy and coordination. The applicant has not managed a department, but did organise a student-event registration file. A useful example explains that work and its limits rather than inventing management responsibility."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original example: turn project work into relevant evidence","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original example: turn project work into relevant evidence"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Advert asks for",{"scope":"col","children":"Advert asks for"}],["$","th","Evidence you could describe",{"scope":"col","children":"Evidence you could describe"}],["$","th","What to keep for an interview",{"scope":"col","children":"What to keep for an interview"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Data accuracy"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Checked duplicate records with spreadsheet rules"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"An anonymised sample and explanation of the checks"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Coordination"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Agreed a handover checklist with two organisers"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"The task division and the part you completed"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Problem solving"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Noticed inconsistent dates and standardised them"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"How the result was validated and any remaining uncertainty"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined",["$","aside",null,{"className":"worked-example","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Worked example"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A truthful structure is: I checked [your actual records], used [a method you can demonstrate], found [the documented issue] and handed over [the output]. Replace every bracket with your facts. Do not add invented percentages just to make a sentence sound measurable."}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
28:["$","section","7-Choose an apply, clarify or watch decision",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Choose an apply, clarify or watch decision"}],[["$","p","Use Apply when the current route, mandatory eligibility and required evidence are clear. Use Clarify when one essential rule needs a written answer. Use Watch when a programme is between rounds, a host is not confirmed or a suitable vacancy has not been published. Keep planning opportunities separate from deadlines you can meet now.",{"children":"Use Apply when the current route, mandatory eligibility and required evidence are clear. Use Clarify when one essential rule needs a written answer. Use Watch when a programme is between rounds, a host is not confirmed or a suitable vacancy has not been published. Keep planning opportunities separate from deadlines you can meet now."}],["$","p","The comparison sheet records the source, location, funding, missing evidence and one next action. Save the actual call alongside your notes. A programme homepage may remain online after an application period ends; a checked date is a record of a review, not an extension of that period.",{"children":"The comparison sheet records the source, location, funding, missing evidence and one next action. Save the actual call alongside your notes. A programme homepage may remain online after an application period ends; a checked date is a record of a review, not an extension of that period."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Choose an apply, clarify or watch decision","children":[["$","a","/downloads/career-opportunity-comparison.csv",{"href":"/downloads/career-opportunity-comparison.csv","download":true,"children":["Download the career opportunity comparison sheet (CSV)",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
29:["$","section","8-Prepare for a multi-stage selection process",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-9","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prepare for a multi-stage selection process"}],[["$","p","Before practising, check the employer’s format and rules. A worked case can help you explain decisions without memorising an artificial model answer.",{"children":"Before practising, check the employer’s format and rules. A worked case can help you explain decisions without memorising an artificial model answer."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Prepare for a multi-stage selection process","children":[["$","$L5","/guides/graduate-assessment-centre/",{"href":"/guides/graduate-assessment-centre/","children":["Graduate assessment centres: practise the decisions",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
